keywords:
  - cloth
  - BRDF
  - SVBRDF
  - neural materials
  - dataset
  - Mitsuba 3
abstract: >-
  500 real cloth materials captured robotically under calibrated camera and
  light configurations and reconstructed as neural BRDFs with a two-stage
  pipeline (a shared BRDF decoder prior, then a dense per-material latent
  texture), plus a Mitsuba 3 renderer for the released materials.
